  "question": {
    "text": "The length of a simple pendulum executing simple harmonic motion is increased by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>21</mn><mo>%</mo></math>. The percentage increase in the time period of the pendulum of increased length is",
